{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WVqKncjBMXL5be-kH-xgaQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:54.501916+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WVqKncjBMXL5be-kH-xgaQ","html":"<div><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>大连工业大学食品学院即日启动接收2027年推荐免试研究生预报名工作，结合我院实际情况，制定本通知，欢迎各位优秀学子踊跃报名。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>接收推免预报名的学科专业</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>083200食品科学与工程、086000生物与医药、095500食品与营养。</span></p><p><span>此专业目录仅供接收推免预报名时参考，最终推免及录取专业以“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开管理服务系统”中大连工业大学推免专业目录为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>推免预报名时间安排</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>预报名起始时间：2026年9月8日（下午1点）</span></p><p><span>预报名截止时间（预计）：2026年9月16日</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请条件</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 遵纪守法，品行良好，身心健康，学习成绩优异。</span></p><p><span>2. 2027年普通高等学校应届本科毕业生，本科期间学习成绩优秀，且获得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格。</span></p><p><span>3. 身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>四</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请材料</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）申请人在预报名时需提交以下材料电子版（pdf）扫描件：</span></p><p><span>1. 本人有效身份证、学生证；</span></p><p><span>2. 《大连工业大学食品学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名表》；</span></p><p><span>3. 本科成绩单（加盖所在本科院校教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>4. 学术论文、著作、专利等能证明科研能力的相关材料；</span></p><p><span>5. 大学英语等级证书、获奖证书等。</span></p><p><span>（二）食品科学与工程专业招收直博生，特别欢迎具有优秀研究潜质的同学直接申请攻读博士学位，有意直博者请与学院研究生招生办公室进行咨询。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>五</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>推免预报名方式</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>参加大连工业大学食品学院接收推荐免试研究生预报名的考生请将申请材料发送至食品学院研究生招生邮箱spxy_fdd@163.com。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>六</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>复试安排</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>     复试考核工作将于9月18日通过线上方式开展，重点考察外语能力、专业知识、综合素质等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>七</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>录取规则</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 我院将本次预推免复试合格者名单上报学校研究生招生办公室进行审核。获得推免生资格的应届本科毕业生确定拟申请的专业后，在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开管理服务系统”（https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm，以下简称“推免服务系统”，开通时间以中国研招网公告为准）填报专业志愿，推免生在规定时间内，登录推免服务系统，确认接受我校发送的待录取通知，逾期未确认者视为放弃。</span></p><p><span>2. 参加我院预推免复试且成绩合格的考生将作为第一批次拟录取对象，根据复试总成绩从高到低（复试总成绩相同时则优先参考综合素质面试成绩排名，其次为专业知识考核成绩）依次优先录取预推免申报专业与正式报考专业一致的考生。</span></p><p><span>3. 未进行预报名的同学仍可登录推免服务系统进行报名，学院根据实际情况择优选拔。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>八</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>咨询电话</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>食品学院研究生招生办公室电话：</span><span>0411-86324875</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><span>spxy_fdd@163.com</span></p><p><span>联系人：冯丁丁老师</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>                                                                 </span></p><p><span> 大连工业大学食品学院</span></p><p><span>                                                                             2026年9月8日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WVqKncjBMXL5be-kH-xgaQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件：大连工业大学食品学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名表.doc</a> </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>图文/冯丁丁</span></span></p><p><span><span>排版/侯懿珊 韩佳雨</span></span></p><p><span><span>责编/王艺霏</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核/孙娜 吴海涛 李明峰<img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/y0GoUPOVlhc802mESPX8hG7XEcXnibj8g2OsGCXxia2dKlD4IPCJbog788y9Esf8J2KbbQXia6625N0KEstJhj0ZKmQ2gak30VBxnk6tiajwBH4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=62\"/></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"173d8edcfc693e964f4db36935f27ffd8f1eeac652193c823f77372d767942a3","textLength":1154,"sourceSha256":"a840c8aa2594b279159b98668d72b297c9139e83220e5904f01b39d9994cbf49","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-42006f459cbc4ea9c025","title":"2026年大连工业大学食品学院接收2027年推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:54.501916+00:00"}
